OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation fails to find what
OL,4,Acaused sinkholes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into two sinkholes
OL,7,Fthat opened up during city-centre
OL,8,Frenovation work has failed to find out
OL,9,Fwhat caused them.
OL,11,FThe first hole appeared on Orchard
OL,12,FStreet in Preston on 23 July before a
OL,13,Flarger one appeared last week.
OL,15,FThe first crater led to work on the
OL,16,Fthoroughfare, which connects Friargate
OL,17,FSouth to the market area, being put on
OL,18,Fhold.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
